    "content": "<div class=\"gform-instructions\">\n  <h2>How to Complete SCC Log Notes</h2>\n  <p>This form documents daily activities provided through Supported Community Connections (SCC) services. Complete one entry for each service session.</p>\n\n  <details open>\n    <summary><strong>Step 1: Enter Person and Goal Information</strong></summary>\n    <ol>\n      <li><strong>Person Receiving Services Name:</strong> Enter the full name of the individual.</li>\n      <li><strong>IP Goal:</strong> Enter the relevant Individual Plan goal being addressed.</li>\n    </ol>\n    <p style=\"background:#fff8dc;padding:8px;border-left:4px solid #ff9800;margin:10px 0;font-size:12px\">\n      <strong>⚠️ Important:</strong> Date/Times MUST match the timesheet submitted. Any discrepancy will not be billed/paid to the independent contractor. Please submit your notes and timesheet on the 20th of each month.\n    </p>\n  </details>\n\n  <details>\n    <summary><strong>Step 2: Document First Service Entry</strong></summary>\n    <h3>Basic Information:</h3>\n    <ul>\n      <li><strong>Date:</strong> Date of service</li>\n      <li><strong>Start Time:</strong> When service began</li>\n      <li><strong>End Time:</strong> When service ended</li>\n    </ul>\n    \n    <h3>Activity Documentation:</h3>\n    <ul>\n      <li><strong>Choices of Activities Offered:</strong> List all activity options you presented to the individual</li>\n      <li><strong>Specific Location and Activity Selected:</strong> Document where you went and what activity the person chose</li>\n    </ul>\n    \n    <h3>Purpose/Goal (Check all that apply):</h3>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Development of Natural Supports in the Community</li>\n      <li>Development or introduction to new skill</li>\n      <li>Sensory Stimulation (visual, auditory, tactile, etc.)</li>\n      <li>Recreation and/or leisure</li>\n      <li>Educational/Knowledge Building</li>\n      <li>Other (specify)</li>\n    </ul>\n    \n    <h3>Detailed Explanation:</h3>\n    <p><strong>What is the purpose, or the goal of the activity?</strong> Check off the opportunities that the activity provided. Use the explanation area to detail:</p>\n    <ul>\n      <li>The individual's level of participation</li>\n      <li>Their response to the activity</li>\n      <li><strong>DO NOT use:</strong> \"Good day, bad day, etc.\"</li>\n      <li>Be specific and objective in your observations</li>\n    </ul>\n    \n    <h3>Community Connections:</h3>\n    <p><strong>Who did individual connect with in the community? Were prompts needed?</strong></p>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Describe interactions with community members</li>\n      <li>Indicate level of support: Verbal, Physical, or Independent</li>\n    </ul>\n    \n    <h3>Successes and Support Needs:</h3>\n    <p><strong>Discuss Successes and/or areas where additional support may be needed:</strong></p>\n    <ul>\n      <li>What went well?</li>\n      <li>What challenges were encountered?</li>\n      <li>What additional support might help?</li>\n    </ul>\n    \n    <h3>Goal Implementation:</h3>\n    <p><strong>Document how the goal was implemented today:</strong></p>\n    <ul>\n      <li>How did today's activity relate to the IP goal?</li>\n      <li>What specific actions supported goal progress?</li>\n      <li>What outcomes were observed?</li>\n    </ul>\n  </details>\n\n  <details>\n    <summary><strong>Step 3: Document Second Service Entry (If Applicable)</strong></summary>\n    <p>If you provided a second service session on the same day or a different day, complete Entry #2 with the same level of detail as Entry #1.</p>\n    <p>Each entry should document:</p>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Separate date and times</li>\n      <li>Different activities or locations</li>\n      <li>Distinct observations and outcomes</li>\n    </ul>\n  </details>\n\n  <details>\n    <summary><strong>Step 4: Sign and Submit</strong></summary>\n    <ol>\n      <li><strong>SCC Provider Signature:</strong> Enter your name to certify these notes</li>\n      <li><strong>Date:</strong> Date of completion</li>\n      <li>Review all entries for accuracy and completeness</li>\n      <li>Verify times match your timesheet</li>\n      <li>Click <strong>Submit Log Notes</strong></li>\n    </ol>\n    <p style=\"background:#fff8dc;padding:8px;border-left:4px solid #ff9800;margin:10px 0\">\n      <strong>Deadline:</strong> Submit notes and timesheet by the <strong>20th of each month</strong>.\n    </p>\n  </details>\n</div>",
